(69, 26, '_cpm_identity_bio', 'Im Pepijn, a full-stack developer and student based in the Netherlands. I like building applications, understanding hardware and looking at the world trough my camera.'),
(70, 26, '_cpm_hardware_lens', 'When im not coding, i love to tinker with computer hardware and capturing the world trough my vision, obsessing over composition and how things work underneath.'),
(71, 26, '_cpm_philosophy', 'Always curious, constantly experimenting and driven by a disire to learn new technologies and improving the craft'),
